<title>USA: Porta says 94 pct of debentures tendered.</title>
<headline>Porta says 94 pct of debentures tendered.</headline>
<dateline>SYOSSET, N.Y. 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Porta Systems Corp said Friday 94 percent of its six percent convertible subordinated debentures due 2002 were tendered pursuant to its offer.</p>
<p>The company said it extended until August 31 its offer to exchange the debentures for shares of common stock and zero coupon senior subordinated convertible notes due January 2, 1998.</p>
<p>Porta Systems makes and sells communications equipment used in voice, video and data networks.</p>
